The shoreline. A geography whose areas stop at the water has a matching mesh of
just that edge, which the lake overlay fades along; the agglomeration has no such
mesh, so its lake is drawn without one.

// #hidden
// #label Shoreline
// #hint The edge where the areas meet the water.

// #region mapDataTypes
lakeBorders: import("d3").GeoPermissibleObjects;
// #endregion

// #region mapData
lakeBorders: topojson.mesh(topo, topo.objects[__LAKE_BOUNDS_LAYER__]),
// #endregion

// #region mapProps
.lakeBorders(state.mapData.lakeBorders)
// #endregion
